    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "业务模块(9 个业务服务)",
      "items": [
        "网关(8080) 认证(9200) 系统(9201) 商品(9205) 会员(9206) 订单(9207) H5聚合(9208) 购物车(9209) 支付(9210)",
        "channel 为 H5 BFF 聚合商品(无库); 购物车纯 Redis",
        "服务间调用: auth→system/user, order→cart/product/user, channel→product, payment→order(@InnerAuth)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "库与表",
      "items": [
        "系统库: sys_user/role/menu/dept/dict/config/post/notice/oper_log/logininfor + 5 关联表",
        "业务库: 商品(product/product_sku/product_details/category/brand/category_brand/product_spec/product_unit/sku_stock)、会员(user_info/user_address/region)、订单(order_info/order_item/order_log)、支付(payment_info)、代码生成(gen_*)、任务(sys_job/sys_job_log)",
        "Redis: 会话/验证码/购物车/结算号/密码锁定; 各业务服务一个 MySQL 库"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "orange",
      "title": "MQ / 支付宝",
      "items": [
        "RabbitMQ: order→延迟关单/解锁, payment→支付成功, 商品消费 spzx.minus/unlock",
        "支付宝: payment→WAP 支付, 回调 RSA2 验签",
        "数据源/交换机队列见 Nacos application-dev.yml"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
